senses.gloss:
--deities of: kites, vul- tures, cranes, and banyan trees, not accepted by आर्य reli- gion;
1: भा. V. १४. २९.
Shine in Kali and oppose Vedic religion;
2: V. २०. 8 and २३.
created by Indra; followers of शिव according to the curse of भ्२ऋगु. Two kinds, one naked and the other wearing red clothes;
3: IV. 2. २८ and ३०; १९. २४-25, ३५-36.
वृद्धश्रावक, Nirgrantha, शाक्य, आजिवक and कार्पट are some sects: vanquished by Pramati in a देवासुर war.
4: Br. II. ३१. ५३, ६६ and ८०; III. १४. ३९; ७४. २०७.
